WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The live recorder starts Pi with one engineering objective.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pi consults Decapod's embedded operating contract.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Decapod binds the task claim to this agent.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Decapod authorizes an isolated workspace for the claimed task.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The required authorization check actually runs and fails. Decapod rejects the candidate.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Pi reads the actual Node assertion. The check expected false and observed true.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Pi requests a source edit after the failed check.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Fresh validation reports both required checks passed for the repaired head.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Decapod publishes the actual pull request and verifies its head. Independent GitHub readback confirms head and target.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Pi exits after 33 tool calls. The published PR head and accepted target match the actual GitHub readback.
